sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Utilisateur
    participant API as Next.js API
    participant GPT as GPT-4o-mini
    participant DB as Prisma / DB
    participant UI as Front-end

    User->>+API: POST /api/meal-plans/generate

    API->>+DB: findUnique(user) + feedback.findMany(last 100)
    DB-->>-API: user profile, feedbackPatterns, previousRecipeNames

    Note over API: buildAdaptiveSection() — cuisines liked/disliked, difficulty, cook-time<br/>buildBudgetSection() — budget feasibility assessment (on_track / tight / unrealistic)<br/>buildVarietySection() — cuisine targets, previous plan avoid-list

    API->>+GPT: Appel 1 — Strategie semaine (~900 tokens, temperature=0.35)
    GPT-->>-API: cuisineTargets, breakfastAnchors, lunchAnchors, leftoverPairs

    Note over API: buildMealPlanPrompt() + buildStrategySection()

    API->>+GPT: Appel 2 — 21 repas complets (~12 000 tokens, temperature=0.55)
    GPT-->>-API: meals [ ...21 recettes JSON... ]

    Note over API: normalizeMeal() x21 — clean les types<br/>syncLeftoverFlags() — lie dinner.hasLeftovers → lunch.usesLeftovers<br/>reconcileNutrition() — rescale macros pour coller aux calories cible<br/>validateMeals() → critical[] + soft[]

    loop Si critical.length > 0 — max 2 tentatives
        API->>+GPT: Appel repair — corriger les erreurs listees (temperature=0.2)
        GPT-->>-API: meals [ ...corrigees... ]
        Note over API: re-validate apres chaque repair
    end

    API->>+DB: $transaction 30s — MealPlan.create + 21xRecipe.create + 21xMealPlanSlot.create
    Note over DB: Atomique — tout ou rien. Si echec, rien n'est ecrit.
    DB-->>-API: planId, created=21

    API->>DB: user.update learnedPrefs — patterns extraits des feedbacks

    API-->>-UI: JSON success, planId, adapted, insights
    UI-->>User: router.refresh() — affiche le nouveau plan
